      "patternId": "n7-negotiation-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-58.t05",
      "en": "You can move in on the first, provided that the deposit is paid.",
      "es": "Puedes mudarte el día uno, siempre que se haya pagado el depósito.",
